OL,3,A'I only use the washing machine on a   
OL,4,ASunday' - how we're keeping our energy 
OL,5,Abills down                             
OL,7,FDomestic energy prices are set to soar 
OL,8,Fin January under the regulator Ofgem's 
OL,9,Fnew price cap, pushing up bills for    
OL,10,Fmillions of households across England, 
OL,11,FScotland and Wales.                    
OL,13,FWith household budgets already under   
OL,14,Fpressure, finding ways to reduce gas   
OL,15,Fand electricity costs has become       
OL,16,Fincreasingly important. But how much   
OL,17,Fdifference can simple changes really   
OL,18,Fmake?                                  
OL,20,FThe BBC spoke to three people about    
OL,21,Fwhat they're doing to keep their energy
OL,22,Fcosts down.                            
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
