OL,3,A'I only use the washing machine on a   
OL,4,ASunday' - how we're keeping our energy 
OL,5,Abills down                             
OL,7,FLike many people, Kelly Anne Harvey, a 
OL,8,Fbuilding surveyor from Cleveleys near  
OL,9,FBlackpool, is worried about her energy 
OL,10,Fbill going up next year.               
